OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,FWords by Jamel Smith, Producer
OL,9,FFrance and Spain have been battling
OL,10,Funprecedented wildfires over the past
OL,11,Fweek, forcing about 325,000 people to
OL,12,Fevacuate.
OL,14,FThe fires are some of the most extreme
OL,15,FEurope has suffered. Such is their
OL,16,Fintensity - fires in France have been
OL,17,Fdescribed as atomic in their power -
OL,18,Fthat they have created their own
OL,19,Fweather systems known as
OL,20,Fpyrocumulonimbus - or fire cloud.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
