OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,FExperts say this is the first time
OL,8,Fthese massive thunderstorm clouds have
OL,9,Fbeen seen in France.
OL,11,FVictor Resco de Dios, a lecturer in
OL,12,FForestry Engineering and Global Change
OL,13,Fat the University of Lleida and
OL,14,Fresearcher at Agrotecnio, said: "We
OL,15,Fhave entered an era of fires that
OL,16,Fcannot be extinguished. These are
OL,17,Ffires that burn with the intensity of
OL,18,Fseveral atomic bombs and, as such,
OL,19,Fputting them out is extremely complex."
OL,26,@sD@Brt
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
