OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,FHere's what you need to know about
OL,8,Fpyrocumulonimbus.
OL,10,FWhat is a fire cloud?
OL,12,FFire clouds, also known as
OL,13,Fpyrocumulonimbus (pyroCb) clouds, are
OL,14,Fextremely powerful fire-generated
OL,15,Fthunderstorms.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,F"It develops when an intense wildfire
OL,8,Freleases enough heat to generate a
OL,9,Frapidly rising column of hot air,
OL,10,Fsmoke and moisture. If the atmosphere
OL,11,Fis sufficiently unstable, this plume
OL,12,Fcan grow into a fully developed
OL,13,Fthunderstorm cloud," Dr Francesca Di
OL,14,FGiuseppe, Fire Forecast Coordinator at
OL,15,Fthe European Centre for Medium-Range
OL,16,FWeather Forecasts (ECMWF), said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,F"The formation of a pyrocumulonimbus
OL,8,Findicates that the fire is interacting
OL,9,Fstrongly with the atmosphere and has
OL,10,Fbegun to generate its own weather,"
OL,11,Fshe continued.
OL,13,FThe smoke plumes that form a fire
OL,14,Fcloud can reach altitudes of 10 to 15
OL,15,Fkilometres (six to nine miles),
OL,16,Fpenetrating the stratosphere.
OL,18,FNasa has even described the plumes as
OL,19,Fthe "fire-breathing dragon of clouds".
OL,21,FHow dangerous is a fire cloud?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
