PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,FFire clouds can make wildfires
OL,8,Fsignificantly more unpredictable and
OL,9,Fdangerous.
OL,11,FThese storms can produce powerful and
OL,12,Ferratic winds, intense downdrafts and
OL,13,Flightning strikes, making fire
OL,14,Fbehaviour highly unpredictable and
OL,15,Fposing a serious risk to firefighters
OL,16,Fand nearby communities, according to
OL,17,FDr Giuseppe.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,F"In some cases, pyrocumulonimbus
OL,8,Fevents can inject smoke into the upper
OL,9,Ftroposphere or even the lower
OL,10,Fstratosphere, reaching altitudes
OL,11,Fcomparable to those associated with a
OL,12,Fmoderate volcanic eruption," Dr
OL,13,FGiuseppe said.
OL,15,FThe Royal Meteorological Society said
OL,16,Fthe rain produced by these storms can
OL,17,Fcreate a downdraft of cooler air,
OL,18,Fwhich can carry embers away from the
OL,19,Fmain blaze and ignite new fires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
