PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,FIn some cases, dry lightning from fire
OL,8,Fclouds can strike without rainfall,
OL,9,Ffurther spreading wildfires.
OL,11,FThey have also been linked to the
OL,12,Fformation of dangerous fire tornadoes.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,19,FHas this happened before?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
