PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785154708
OL,3,CWhat are pyrocumulonimbus clouds and
OL,4,Chow are they fuelling France's
OL,5,Cwildfires?
OL,7,FFire clouds are well documented in
OL,8,FAustralia, Canada and the western
OL,9,FUnited States, where they are
OL,10,Fassociated with some of the most
OL,11,Fextreme wildfires, Dr Giuseppe said.
OL,13,FThey remain relatively rare in Europe.
OL,15,FHowever, the Royal Meteorological
OL,16,FSociety warned that as the climate
OL,17,Fchanges, these unusual but significant
OL,18,Fstorms could become more frequent as
OL,19,Fhotter and drier conditions increase
OL,20,Fthe risk of wildfires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
